    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">I'm Breaking Free</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Again, her gaze moved to the semi-unconscious figure of Catra. She was breathing in labored gasps, shivering. For the first time, she truly saw the Horde soldier as something different. A hurt child that had been forced into something she didnâ€™t understand. A child soldier who had cuts, bruises, burns, all from being forced to fight.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
